      "html": "<p>An Ofsted inspection is easier when you have run it on yourself. Ofsted regulates early years in England. A mock inspection is a walk against the Early Years Foundation Stage, as an inspector would do it. The score does not matter. The list of gaps does. So does the plan you leave behind.</p>"
